# OurCity — Smart Sanitation

> AI-powered waste management and illegal dumping detection platform for a cleaner, smarter Nagpur.

## 📌 Project

OurCity is an intelligent waste-management platform designed for the Viksit Nagpur theme.

The system transforms citizen waste reports into actionable intelligence by:

- Detecting and classifying waste using AI
- Identifying illegal dumping hotspots
- Prioritizing waste-collection requests
- Predicting recurring dumping locations
- Optimizing municipal garbage collection routes
- Providing an NMC monitoring dashboard

## 🎯 Problem

Inconsistent waste collection and illegal dumping can create recurring sanitation problems in open spaces and residential areas.

Traditional complaint systems are mainly reactive:

Citizen reports → Municipality responds

OurCity aims to move toward:

Citizen data → AI analysis → Hotspot intelligence → Prediction → Route optimization → Resolution

## 🚀 MVP Features

- [ ] Citizen waste reporting
- [ ] Image upload
- [ ] GPS location detection
- [ ] AI waste classification
- [ ] Waste severity detection
- [ ] Automatic ticket generation
- [ ] Ward assignment
- [ ] Illegal dumping hotspot detection
- [ ] Hotspot prediction
- [ ] NMC dashboard
- [ ] Waste heatmap
- [ ] Garbage truck route optimization
- [ ] Collection analytics

